# TEST FIXTURE (id 91): zone banner + animated sprites (contract section 22). Not part of the game: reached only by the host
# harness (tools/host_world, `make zones`). Outdoor area "villa_aliso" with an animated tile patch and an animated flag (maps/test_catalog.toml),
# a warp east to test_zone_b (another area, no animation) and a door south to test_zone_in (an interior: no area).
@map test_zone_a
@size 10 8
@interior no
@bg 0
@area villa_aliso
@fill grass_a
@spawn start 2 2 S
@spawn from_b 7 4 W
@spawn from_in 4 5 S
@legend
  .  tile=grass_a
  a  tile=test_anim_tile
  F  object=test_anim_flag
  e  tile=mat
  d  tile=mat
@grid
  ..........
  ..aaa.....
  ..aaa...F.
  ..........
  ........e.
  ..........
  ....d.....
  ..........
@warp e -> test_zone_b spawn=from_a
@warp d -> test_zone_in spawn=from_a
